{"entry_id": "GC-0002", "case_class": "boundary", "source_kind": "sample", "design_note": "边界：只有一张原图（position 2/3/7 不出图），competitor_clean 是条件项 —— 此时应判 not_applicable，而不是 fail。用来考『条件项不被误判成失败』。", "inputs": [{"kind": "product_facts_source", "ref": "examples/product_demo.json", "sha256": "bb941a4eaecfc3fd5dcc43b121a098a2c31e4ade6074530956e28866f0417013"}, {"kind": "material_image", "ref": "examples/input/cup_source.jpg", "sha256": "565fd5b74a9a956a3495281ec071f1d9428e685f78546bc846b9fdb220851d90"}], "facts_version": "pfv1-84b477d51baf", "exercised_items": ["pr.competitor_clean", "cf.composition"]}
{"entry_id": "GC-0003", "case_class": "critical_error", "source_kind": "sample", "design_note": "明显关键错误：第 6 条卖点含图上禁用词（全网最低 / 绝对 / 最好）。候选图若把它叠上去，pr.forbidden_on_image 必须 fail —— 这一类错误的负例来源。", "inputs": [{"kind": "product_facts_source", "ref": "examples/product_demo.json", "sha256": "bb941a4eaecfc3fd5dcc43b121a098a2c31e4ade6074530956e28866f0417013"}, {"kind": "material_image", "ref": "examples/input/cup_source.jpg", "sha256": "565fd5b74a9a956a3495281ec071f1d9428e685f78546bc846b9fdb220851d90"}], "facts_version": "pfv1-84b477d51baf", "exercised_items": ["pr.forbidden_on_image"]}
{"entry_id": "GC-0004", "case_class": "hard_judgement", "source_kind": "sample", "design_note": "难判：位置 7 会把竞品原图并排放进成品图。『这张图里有没有别人的 logo』和『杯身 logo 与原片是否一致』机器都判不了，只能人眼看 —— 用来考 unknown 与 fail 的界线。", "inputs": [{"kind": "product_facts_source", "ref": "examples/product_fullset.json", "sha256": "ed0523c0b956a2c4f1636f36e8589fcf96ed72592d76f886038bb8ffb317fb54"}, {"kind": "material_image", "ref": "examples/input/cup_source.jpg", "sha256": "565fd5b74a9a956a3495281ec071f1d9428e685f78546bc846b9fdb220851d90"}, {"kind": "material_image", "ref": "examples/input/competitor.jpg", "sha256": "677efb17d1264d28fd7255d95ed838fbd261f950b892d779fa7c93a27319fbd2"}], "facts_version": "pfv1-f9e80514a2c9", "exercised_items": ["cf.appearance", "pr.competitor_clean"]}
{"entry_id": "GC-0005", "case_class": "unknown", "source_kind": "sample", "design_note": "两份来源对重量（320g / 350g）与高度（22 cm / 22 centimeters）说法不一致 → 合并后 spec.weight 与 spec.height 都是 conflicted，人只能判 unknown。用来考『Unknown 不被当成 pass』，也考合并路径真的生效。", "inputs": [{"kind": "product_facts_source", "ref": "examples/product_fullset.json", "sha256": "ed0523c0b956a2c4f1636f36e8589fcf96ed72592d76f886038bb8ffb317fb54"}, {"kind": "product_facts_source", "ref": "evals/product-v1/dataset/inputs/product_weight_350g.json", "sha256": "91193d4172e6f67b5a596cfa46ad54ca3c0b8dc04d68340536328ec326eae325"}, {"kind": "material_image", "ref": "examples/input/cup_source.jpg", "sha256": "565fd5b74a9a956a3495281ec071f1d9428e685f78546bc846b9fdb220851d90"}], "facts_version": "pfv1-5540866fef59", "exercised_items": ["cf.spec_claim"]}
